---
layout: base.njk
title: Stats
permalink: /stats/
---
<h1>Readings</h1>

<p>What the instruments picked up from <a href="{{ github.url }}">my GitHub</a> the last time this site was built. Measured in bytes of code, which is to say: imprecisely.</p>

{% if not github.languages or github.languages.length == 0 %}
<p class="faint-note">The signal is weak right now. The readings will return on the next build.</p>
{% else %}
<pre class="ascii-stats" aria-label="Languages by bytes of code">
{%- for l in github.languages %}
{{ l.label }} {{ l.bar }} {{ l.pct }}%
{%- endfor %}
</pre>

<table class="stats-table">
  <thead><tr><th>Language</th><th>Share</th><th>Repos</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {%- for l in github.languages %}
    <tr><td>{{ l.name }}</td><td>{{ l.pct }}%</td><td>{{ l.repos }}</td></tr>
  {%- endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
{% endif %}

<h2>The log</h2>
<pre class="ascii-stats">
public repos ....... {{ github.publicRepos }}
followers .......... {{ github.followers }}
stars collected .... {{ github.stars }}
first repo ......... {{ github.firstYear }}
last signal ........ {{ github.lastPush | readableDate if github.lastPush else "unknown" }}
code on record ..... {{ (github.totalBytes / 1024) | round | int }} KB
</pre>

<p class="faint-note">Forks and the profile repo are left out. Rebuilt whenever the site is.</p>
